{"id":"sensacio_n","lemma":"sensación","pos":"noun","rank":1264,"glosses":["sensation","feeling"],"ipa":"/sensaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sensaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sensaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una sensación extraña.","en":"It's just a weird feeling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611322"},{"text":"La sensación es simplemente distinta.","en":"It just feels different.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299981"},{"text":"Yo también tengo esa sensación.","en":"That's my feeling as well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/605052"},{"text":"Tuve exactamente la misma sensación.","en":"I had the exact same feeling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590338"},{"text":"Yo también tengo una sensación similar.","en":"I have a similar feeling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458755"}]}